    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήψ</span></b> , gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σηπός, ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>putrefying
			sore</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.58
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήψ, ὁ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i> (v. infr.), Lucan.<i><span class="en">
				9.723
			</span></i>:—<i>a serpent, the bite of which causes intense
				thirst</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				846b11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.11.1
			</span></i> (cj.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					147
				</span></i>
			; mortification followed, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				16.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>lizard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				817
			</span></i>; also called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαύρα
			Χαλκιδική</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.65
			</span></i>.</div>
